Description: anthra skin anthra_1024 for the VDR text2skin plugin
 16:9 SD (1024x576) variant of the anthra skin by Tomas Saxer
 for the text2skin plugin of VDR.
 .
 The skin is built from its options in /etc/vdr/anthra/anthra_1024.conf,
 see vdr-skin-anthra-update(8).
